sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent client
  participant M as MCP adapter
  participant B as Broker and journal
  participant D as Android backend
  A->>M: tools/call binding.invoke with callback bindings
  M->>B: Pin contracts and authorize registration
  B->>D: Register typed proxy with verified wire contract
  D-->>B: Registration outcome
  B-->>M: Active handle or explicit uncertain outcome
  M-->>A: Single final response with URI and cursor
  A->>M: resources/subscribe to events URI
  D->>B: Callback, bounded local reply if required
  B->>B: Ordered append within quota
  B-->>M: Resource changed
  M-->>A: notifications/resources/updated URI only
  A->>M: resources/read bounded page after cursor
  M-->>A: Typed events, next cursor and loss status
  A->>M: tools/call callback.cancel
  M->>B: Suppress delivery and request cleanup
  B->>D: Verified unregister with recorded token
  M-->>A: Closed and confirmed or unknown cleanup
